    "text": "Reduction of metal centre in aqueous permanganate ion involves<br />\r<br />\r(1) 5 electrons in neutral medium<br />\r(2) 5 electrons in acidic medium<br />\r(3) 3 electrons in neutral medium<br />\r(4) 3 electrons in alkaline medium",
