  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In acidic medium<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br />In neutral medium<br /><br /><math><mtext>Mn</mtext><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>3</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mtext>Mn</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>4O</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Hence, number of electrons gained in acidic and neutral mediums are 5 and 3 electrons respectively.",
